          "title": "Motion 1",
          "text": "This command sets the position of the sprite on the stage using coordinates.\n1. Place the sprite in a certain place, and the command \"Go to x: __ y: __\" will contain the coordinate values corresponding to that position.\n2. Drag the \"Go to x: __ y: __\" block from the command palette. ",
